DNS zones version management.

USAGE:
  scw dns version <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  diff        Access differences from a specific DNS zone version
  list        List versions of a DNS zone
  restore     Restore a DNS zone version
  show        List records from a given version of a specific DNS zone

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for version
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use

Use "scw dns version [command] --help" for more information about a command.
